  "description": "YITAMOTOR floor mats completely line the interior carpet to provide all-encompassing protection. We are confident that our products will surpass your expectations and make you a happy customer!\nFitment\n2012-2015 Honda Civic(Not fit for 2 doors coupe model )\nFor your safety, professional installation is highly recommended.\nFeatures\nCustom Fit: Compatible with 2012 2013 2014 2015 Honda Civic, Applies unique precision digital laser scanning to ensure and accurate interior carpet lining, Please remember to double-check the car model before ordering. NOTE: Includes 2 front floor mats & 1 rear floor liner,Only for 4 doors, not for coupe.\nAll-Weather Guard: Built using TPE tri-extruded composition that is safe, odorless, and environmentally sound in all weather conditions (rain, fog, snow, etc.); Floor liners provide protection to the front and rear of your car\nTough & Durable: Offers Better temperature resistance than PVC materials; The mats are odorless, contain no latex, cadmium, lead or harmful PVC; High tensity TPE material provides a superb feel and extreme wear-resistance, as well as constant flexibility even in harsh cold weather\nNon-Slip Design & Easy To Clean: Floor mats provide a rugged and durable grip that will not slip; Can be conveniently wiped down to not accumulate stains; High-density core materials trap milk, snow, dirt, sand, etc., to keep your car and shoes clean; Get your vehicle carpets looking nice and new once again\nWhy Choose YITAMOTOR: Our floor mats are processed with advanced technology, rendering tailored protection and all-weather guard to your vehicle.",
